<title>UK: BOE sells net 4.109 bln stg UK gilts in Oct.</title>
<headline>BOE sells net 4.109 bln stg UK gilts in Oct.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of England (BOE) sold a net 4.109 billion stg of gilt-edged stock in October after 2.923 billion in September, BOE statistics showed.</p>
<p> NET PURCHASES OF GILTS (in million stg) -  Oct    Sept</p>
<p> Banks (a)					    294    654</p>
<p> Building societies				 482     72</p>
<p> M4 private sector				  845  1,796</p>
<p> Overseas					   2,335    483</p>
<p>NOTES - (a) includes discount houses; minus sign denotes net sale; data exclude repurchase transactions with BoE; previously released data in brackets.</p>
</text>
